  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "\"Hey, Vik, I've been going over some of your notes and I'm afraid you're a couple of decimal points off on some of your figures\"",
          "rhyme": "yR",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "\"Out! I have no time for you\"",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "\"Okay! Find out for yourself!\"",
          "rhyme": "Elf",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABC",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABC"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "It lasts longer if you take a picture, it's Viktor the Slickster",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I pick her, sip Schlitz Malt Liquor",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Still up in the mixture like a fixture",
          "rhyme": "yR",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Y'all seen the sticker with the sick filling: \"VIKSTA\"",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "He stacks chips by any which way",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "And keep black lips, fuck what any bitch say",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "It ain't no time for no tit-for-tat",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Y'all better aim for the head, just don't hit the fitted hat",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "When it's his time to go, it's his time to go",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "As for right now though – 'The Hour Show' rhyme flow",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "He got more of those that lines for dime ho's",
          "rhyme": "ins",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "That act fancy, with more clothes than Delancey",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Don't let him house you out on Houston",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Or catch you downtown on Broadway, browsin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Whoever got the most bags get followed",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Give it up or get you and the old hag hollowed",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "\"Smash!\" It's Viktor the Slickster",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDAEDDFFGEHIAAA",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDAEDDFFGEHIAAA"
    },
