    {
      "section_id": "section_5",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Tender-headed, get they wig split with 'Fro Sheen",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "V manufacture gun cleaning kits for Podine",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Party people ask him, \"How you so mean",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "And still quiet? Could it be the codeine in your diet?\"",
          "rhyme": "Et",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I'm like, \"What I look like? A doctor?!\"",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Let the pork stop, I got the clear meat, the vodka",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Cork top, step up the hustle like the new guy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Gun bustin' and drugs, the penalties' too high",
          "rhyme": "Eg",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Makes you wonder who they speak for",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "It's only one side benefitin' off the street war",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "And it's heat galore, just to make it badder",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Many gone stab they own man up, like Jacob Ladder",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "I still worry when I'm out on the hop hot",
          "rhyme": "Ot",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Drill a ill flurry that might bop your knot",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "I fill the Bill Murray, get more run than The Wop got",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Shop for a yacht (*glouckpp!*) — popsnot",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "*glouck*... *glouck*... *glouck*",
          "rhyme": "yk",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AAABCDEFCGHHIJJJK",
